<title>JAPAN: Jinlong smelter plans Feb 28 start--Sumitomo Metal.</title>
<headline>Jinlong smelter plans Feb 28 start--Sumitomo Metal.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Jinlong copper smelter project in China's Anhui province is targeted to start production on February 28, a spokesman for Sumitomo Metal Mining Co, a 20-percent owner of the project, said on Monday.</p>
<p>He said the furnace was ignited at the end of last year.</p>
<p>The project will have an annual capacity of 100,000 tonnes per year.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
